                "title": "Rustic Arched Covered Deadbolt, Baldwin RAD",
                "description": "Baldwin RAD, Rustic Arched Covered Deadbolt - The Rustic Arched Deadbolt has a covered cylinder that puts it over to top for elegance. It is available in dark bronze and white bronze finishes and both has a 25 year warranty. The Baldwin Reserve Rustic Arch Deadbolt will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will accommodate both 2-3/4 inch and 2-3/8 inch backsets as well as doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick. A grade 2 lock, this traditional deadbolt has a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
